WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:02.700
The 100 Billion Betrayal.

00:00:02.650 --> 00:00:05.450
How Canada Broke Its Military.

00:00:05.450 --> 00:00:11.737
In World War Two, Canadian shipyards built over 400 warships in under five years.

00:00:11.737 --> 00:00:19.687
Today, Canada has spent 30 years and over 100 billion dollars and has not delivered a single combat surface ship.
